  "about": {
    "zh": "一个 Q 版鲸鱼娘,二头身,侧身朝右站;蓝色长发、头顶一根呆毛,头两侧各一只鲸鱼鳍,身后一条鲸鱼尾巴;服装是括号里选的那套:女仆装是女仆裙和印着配色对应厂商标志的围裙,冬装是戴鲸鱼兜帽、围条纹围巾的斗篷,店员装是扎单马尾、戴红色遮阳帽和耳麦、穿条纹衬衫和红裙的快餐店员制服,睡裙是淡蓝水手领睡裙配奶白荷叶边、印小鲸鱼的围裙前襟和蓝色蝴蝶结,头发编成两条麻花辫,睡觉时身下出现贝壳床、月亮抱枕、被子和床头灯,工装是扎高马尾、穿小领口无袖深蓝背心和浅灰蓝工装裙,背心袖口是三片鲸鳍形翻边,腰侧挂一只小鲸鱼挂件,后腰留尾巴开口",
    "en": "a chibi whale girl, two heads tall, standing three-quarters on facing right; long blue hair with an ahoge, a whale fin on each side of the head, and a whale tail behind; she wears the outfit picked in brackets: the maid dress is a maid dress with an apron printed with the logo of the colour scheme's vendor, the winter outfit a cape with a whale hood and a striped scarf, and the crew uniform a fast-food crew uniform with a single ponytail, a red visor and headset, a striped shirt and a red skirt; the nightgown a pale blue sailor-collar nightdress with cream ruffles, a whale-print bib and a blue bow, her hair in twin braids, and a shell bed with a moon cushion, a blanket and a bedside lamp when she sleeps in it; the workwear is a small-collared sleeveless indigo work vest with three whale-fin flounces at each armhole, worn with a light grey-blue utility skirt with a tail opening at the lower back and a small whale charm at the hip, and a high ponytail"
  },
